IRWB-020-F is ready for review. The [ticket](ttmp/2026/11/26/IRWB-020-F--tix-language-tensor-ir-evaluators-meaning-contract-and-checked-passes/index.md), [design](ttmp/2026/11/26/IRWB-020-F--tix-language-tensor-ir-evaluators-meaning-contract-and-checked-passes/design-doc/01-stage-1-design-tix-and-checked-tensor-passes.md), and [diary](ttmp/2026/11/26/IRWB-020-F--tix-language-tensor-ir-evaluators-meaning-contract-and-checked-passes/reference/01-diary.md) are committed.

